    "text": "Stage\nTiming\nDelivery approach\nDecision to proceed\n0  Prototype\nDec 2026\nReview voice, transcription, source retrieval\nand the Shield Advisor experience.\nAgree refinements\nand MVP scope.\nMVP readiness*\nJan 2027\nValidate audio, SMP/benefit sources, access,\nsummary review and desktop integration.\nConfirm Compass-specific\nlaunch readiness.\n1  MVP\nFeb 1–28, 2027\nLaunch initial high-volume intents with\nself-service and a CSR handoff.\nApprove the first\nexpansion release.\n2  Expand\nintents\nMar–Jun 2027\nMonthly releases\nPhase intents toward Top 20. Q1 discovery\nscopes knowledge/coaching extensions.*\nReview performance\nbefore each release.\nPhase 2\ndiscovery\nQ2 2027\nParallel work\nDesign routing and callbacks. Define journey\ncontext and supervisory workflows.*\nAgree pilot scope,\nowners and measures.\n3  Pilots*\nQ3 2027\nPilot routing, context/callbacks and\nsupervisory assistance in selected scopes.\nReview value and\nservice quality.\n4  Expansion*\nQ4 2027\nExtend proven capabilities to eligible\nqueues, LOBs, journeys and channels.\nConfirm continued\nvalue and ownership.",
